n{bmatrix}∗ & 3 & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗ & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗ & ∗\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{3}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement II is false.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only\"." #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186339176 #edb/ref 1080 "-14" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186339176 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186339176 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "05a8d4cf-2a52-5eb3-932c-de54f969d498" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186339240 #edb/ref 1080 "-12" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186339240 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186339240 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "0ca1e367-7e59-5b69-861b-8c5df685d98a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186339255 #edb/ref 1080 "3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186339255 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186339255 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "0dd1e2d3-3d25-597c-a847-faa140432c9c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186339484 #edb/ref 1080 "No solution" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186339484 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186339484 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "28a2b981-6db8-5f16-b21b-6ae088a23e3d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186339553 #edb/ref 1080 "1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186339553 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186339553 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "309c51a6-6646-55e5-a9ef-db0cd36bd5b0" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186339665 #edb/ref 1080 "10" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186339665 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186339665 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "3c2029a1-5daa-5d17-915b-5cb3db9d0a31" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186340130 #edb/ref 1080 "7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186340130 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186340130 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "70e98200-2ef8-5fee-9135-1a64cdf08565" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186340149 #edb/ref 1080 "6" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186340149 #edb/ref 1082 #ed